    "demo.formats.t": { en: "Previews for the files media people actually use", vi: "Xem trước đúng những file dân media hay dùng" },
    "demo.formats":   { en: "<span><b>Video</b> MP4 · MOV · ProRes · HEVC · MKV · WebM · MXF · AVI · MTS / M2TS · MPEG · WMV</span><span><b>Motion</b> Lottie .json & .lottie · Rive .riv (interactive) · GIF · APNG · image sequences · Cavalry .cv · Plate .plate · Autograph .agp / .agt</span><span><b>Projects</b> After Effects, Blender, Cinema 4D: Render Preview (Pro) · Premiere: sequences, used media (Pro) · Resolve, Nuke, Maya…: Choose Preview File (Pro)</span><span><b>3D</b> glTF / GLB (KTX2 textures too) · USD / USDZ · OBJ · STL · FBX · PLY · DAE · 3DS · DXF · 3MF · .blend · .c4d · .skp · .max</span><span><b>Design</b> PSD / PSB · Illustrator .ai · InDesign · Affinity · Figma .fig · Sketch · XD · Procreate · Krita: the preview saved inside</span><span><b>Archives</b> ZIP · RAR · 7Z: the picture inside that looks most like a cover</span>",
                        vi: "<span><b>Video</b> MP4 · MOV · ProRes · HEVC · MKV · WebM · MXF · AVI · MTS / M2TS · MPEG · WMV</span><span><b>Motion</b> Lottie .json & .lottie · Rive .riv (tương tác được) · GIF · APNG · chuỗi ảnh · Cavalry .cv · Plate .plate · Autograph .agp / .agt</span><span><b>Project</b> After Effects, Blender, Cinema 4D: Render Preview (Pro) · Premiere: sequence, media đã dùng (Pro) · Resolve, Nuke, Maya…: Choose Preview File (Pro)</span><span><b>3D</b> glTF / GLB (cả texture KTX2) · USD / USDZ · OBJ · STL · FBX · PLY · DAE · 3DS · DXF · 3MF · .blend · .c4d · .skp · .max</span><span><b>Thiết kế</b> PSD / PSB · Illustrator .ai · InDesign · Affinity · Figma .fig · Sketch · XD · Procreate · Krita: ảnh xem trước lưu sẵn trong file</span><span><b>File nén</b> ZIP · RAR · 7Z: ảnh bên trong giống ảnh bìa nhất</span>" },

